      "levelFormula": "1d6 + 2",
      "instant": false,
      "form": "",
      "description": "<p><strong>Level:</strong> 1d6 + 2</p><p>For one hour per cypher level, you sense any movement within short range, and any large creature or object moving within long range. You also know how many things are moving and how big they are.</p>",
