      "levelFormula": "1d6 + 2",
      "instant": true,
      "form": "",
      "description": "<p><strong>Level:</strong> 1d6 + 2 · <strong>Instant.</strong></p><p>You guess the right PIN or passcode for a phone, lock, card, laptop, website or similar, as long as its level is no higher than the cypher's level.</p>",
