      "levelFormula": "1d6",
      "instant": true,
      "form": "",
      "description": "<p><strong>Level:</strong> 1d6 · <strong>Instant.</strong></p><p>Use 1 level of Stress as an asset on your action without triggering the usual GM intrusion (Using Stress, p129).</p>",
