      "level": 10,
      "levelOverride": true,
      "levelFormula": "10",
      "instant": true,
      "form": "",
      "description": "<p><strong>Level:</strong> 10 · <strong>Instant.</strong></p><p>If you reach the last step on the damage track, you fall into a near-death coma for a week instead of dying. You keep a serious scar after you recover (Damage track, p132).</p>",
      "sourcePage": "108",
      "sourceOrder": 7,
