      "levelFormula": "1d6",
      "instant": true,
      "form": "",
      "description": "<p><strong>Level:</strong> 1d6 · <strong>Instant.</strong></p><p>If you are being chased, you escape and the pursuer eventually gives up. If they get another chance later (say, you come back), a new chase is resolved normally.</p>",
