      "form": "",
      "description": "<p><strong>Level:</strong> 1d6 + 4</p><p>When choosing between two known options, you pick the more correct one: which way a quarry turned, which wire to cut, which of two suspects is guilty. It does nothing if neither option is right.</p>",
